      "statement": "tools/hx-doc/hx-record-check (hx_record_check.py) enforces the template as a gate, reporting MISSING (absent required section), UNRESOLVED (a field recorded as not yet known), and DRIFT (the record's declared state disagrees with hx-fleet.tsv after normalizing and splitting off any /CLOSED gate suffix). By default UNRESOLVED fields do not fail the check; --strict fails the build on them too.",
